PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
19-turn game. sliceofNai's Lamball chip-attacked xNIGHTn early (10->9->8->7->6, turns 1-5), and xNIGHTn's Chillet destroyed two Lamballs in blocks (turn 6). xNIGHTn's Chillet destroyed sliceofNai's Foxparks (turn 7); sliceofNai's Single-Shot Rifle then destroyed xNIGHTn's Chillet (turn 8). sliceofNai deployed Relaxaurus/Chillet after a Black Marketeer graveyard-recursion play (turn 9), but three of sliceofNai's attacks were cancelled by xNIGHTn's Lucky Pal in one turn (turn 10). sliceofNai's Univolt destroyed xNIGHTn's Elphidran Aqua (turn 11), but xNIGHTn's Chillet destroyed Univolt right back and started chipping sliceofNai (turn 13). Astegon and Elphidran Aqua attacks were nullified by xNIGHTn's Foxparks/Cryolinx interrupts (turns 13, 16). xNIGHTn ground sliceofNai down via repeated Chillet hits (10->8->6->4) and finished with Chillet destroying a blocking Lamball then Elphidran Aqua hitting for the final 2 (2 to 0, turn 19).


